{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04476","headline":"洛城观酺应制 · 陈子昂","name":"洛城观酺应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣人信恭己，天命允昭回。\n苍极神功被，青云秘籙开。\n垂衣受金册，张乐宴瑶台。\n云凤休徵满，鱼龙杂戏来。\n崇恩踰五日，惠泽畅三才。\n玉帛羣臣醉，徽章缛礼该。\n方覩升中禅，言观拜洛回。\n微臣固多幸，敢上万年杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04476.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04476","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}